Each turn, those caught in your gloom must save against your Mindpower, or have a [7%, 9%, 10%, 12%, 13% (TL1-5)] chance to be crippled by fear for 3 turns, reducing damage they inflict by [-12%, -17%, -21%, -24%, -26% (TL1-5)]. The first time you melee strike a foe after they have been weakened will give you 2 hate.

The chance increases with your mind speed.

Each point in Gloom talents increases your Mindpower (current total: [1, 4, 7, 9, 12 (TL1-5)]).
